hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1148","Abu Qudamah told us, and Muhammad bin Bashar told us, they said: Yahya told us, Bundar said, he said: Ibn Ajlan told us, and Abu Qudamah said, On the authority of Ibn Ajlan, on the authority of Al-Qaqa’, on the authority of Abu Salih, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, he said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “May God have mercy on a man He got up during the night and prayed, and woke up his wife. If she refused, he sprinkled water on her face. May God have mercy on a woman who got up during the night and prayed, and woke up. Her husband, and if he refuses, she sprinkles water on his face.”"
